[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807497774","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115474#issuecomment-3807497774","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115474","id":3807497774,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7i8c4u","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T20:56:45Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T20:56:45Z","body":"> which in practice adds ~0.3 MB to the minimal template (though that could likely be mitigated by not using built-ins)\r\n\r\njust pointing out that there are no libraries outside builtins on the web platform where the binary size is important the most.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807497774/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3810658264","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115474#issuecomment-3810658264","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115474","id":3810658264,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jIgfY","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-28T11:08:01Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T11:08:01Z","body":"> `RegEx` is used a lot, so it makes sense to move it to the core.\r\n\r\nYeah, I agree, and the size increase is not that bad, especially given that's the uncompressed size (and we'll likely squeeze more with brotli), so I think it's worth it.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3810658264/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3810678240","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115474#issuecomment-3810678240","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115474","id":3810678240,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jIlXg","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-28T11:12:46Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T11:14:10Z","body":"> just pointing out that there are no libraries outside builtins on the web platform where the binary size is important the most.\r\n\r\nTo add to this, **if** we deem that we want to cut size on the web, we could probably implement the regex as a wrapper around JS' [RegExp](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/RegExp)... that would technically be the web builtin... (though performances would likely be terrible due to memory allocations needed when strings cross boundaries)","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3810678240/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5122110627","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115474#issuecomment-5122110627","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115474","id":51221